  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -AR verb based on *afeitar*. Uses reflexive pronouns (me/te/se/nos/se) in all tenses.",
    "All conjugations follow regular -AR endings.",
    "*Me afeito todas las mañanas.* (I shave every morning.)",
    "*Se afeitó antes de la reunión.* (He shaved before the meeting.)",
    "Related: *afeitar* (to shave someone/something), *la afeitadora* (electric shaver), *la maquinilla de afeitar* (razor)"
